# SHE V3 Admin Web — Environment
# V3-ADMIN-WEB-APP §4.
# Same-origin path proxied to the backend by next.config.ts (the backend has no
# CORS config, so a direct cross-origin URL is blocked by the browser).
# For a direct connection instead, set this to http://localhost:8080 and enable
# CORS on the backend for this origin.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=/proxy-api
